360 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 181 0 R
/E (SMOTE addresses class imbalance by generating synthetic samples for the minority \(churn\) class. Rather than duplicating existing records, it interpolates between neighboring minority-class instances in feature space, creating plausible new examples. This enriches the training signal and improves the model's ability to learn churn boundaries.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
